 {d:['Mujer de unos 35 años con mochila','Woman in her 30s with a backpack'],bag:'mochila',col:'#8a6fb3',arco:'ok',bagC:['Un dron pequeño plegado.','A small folded drone.'],bad:'bag',item:['dron','drone'],need:['arco','bolso'],fin:'keep',alt:{out:2},why:['Durante la visita está prohibido volar drones sobre la zona: se retiene el dron hasta la salida y ella entra.','Flying drones over the area is banned during the visit: the drone is kept until she leaves and she goes in.']}
